    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "3. Pronunciation"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Intergermanic uses a straightforward Latin alphabet. Pronunciation broadly follows Norwegian/Scandinavian conventions, which are familiar to the widest range of Germanic speakers."
    },
