    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "12. Adjectives"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Adjectives agree with the noun in gender, number, and case when used attributively (before a noun). Used predicatively (after a copula), they are uninflected."
    },
    {
